WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Crystallization • high → low temperature
Cooling forms high-temperature minerals first, then lower-temperature minerals and more Na-rich plagioclase.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Partial melting • the general order reverses
On heating, lower-melting components enter liquid first. The remaining rock is still partly solid.
